      },
      "message": "fix(ui): show Agie-only controls only for an Agie job\n\nThe Post page inspection section, the operation page export action and\nits hint now need a setup that mounts the AGIECUT CLASSIC 2S wire\nmachine. The Wire page open-cut statements need that machine or the\nnative Agie post. has_agie_inspection_source accepts every die-side DXF\nchain cut, so the export showed on ordinary wire jobs.\n\nFixes #3996\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
